nit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Footing en endurance fondamentale. L'impression en fin de séance doit être celle d'être plus en forme qu'avant de l'avoir commencée. Tu ne dois pas te fatiguer sur cette séance, juste enchaîner les kilomètres sans stress !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_1","description":"Séance pour commencer à prendre tes marques sur le seuil 30' où tu vas enchaîner **8 répétitions de 1'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 1' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"On commence par prendre ses marques avec cette vitesse qui à la fois est inconfortable et à la fois peut être maintenue relativement longtemps (30 minutes sur le papier). Résister à la douleur ça s'apprend, et tu démarres aujourd'hui l'apprentissage.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":8,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1787529600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.049304554401289,"expectedDuration":2760},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"val