sion... Bref fais tout pour accélérer la récupération ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_5_Alternative1","description":"Séance de S60, en variation d'allure, composée de **5 séries**. Chaque série est composée **1' au S30, 2' au S60 et 2' au SweetSpot, enchainé sans repos**. La série se clôture par **2' de récupération**, avant de passer à la série suivante. ","displayName":"Séance S60 alternative : \"Attention aux Baïnes\"","coachAdvice":"Une séance qui permet de balayer un bel éventail de vitesse. Parfait pour apprendre à gérer ses allures et surtout pour apprendre à se connaitre. Donc si tu maitrises mal tes allures, tu vas très certainement partir trop vite. Ce sera un mal pour un bien, tu vas apprendre et c'est aussi le but de l'entrainement.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":1,"t