iningIndex":3,"weekDate":1788739200000,"sport":"ppg","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Même en 3ème semaine de cycle d'entraînement, là où la fatigue est à son maximum, cette sortie devrait commencer à devenir facile à ce stade. Les jambes sont peut-être lourdes avec les séances bien intenses que tu fais, mais ton corps devient de plus en plus capable de faire avec. C'est signe que tu progresses !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_3_Alternative1","description":"Séance mix seuil 30' & VMA. Tu vas commencer par **2 répétitions de 1'** à VMA avec 1' de récupération puis **4 répétitions de 2'** toujours avec 1' de récupération. ","displayName":"Séance S30 alternative : \"Coup de bélier\"","coachAdvice":"On commence avec quelques intervalles à  VMA aujourd'hui ce qui permet, en plus d'un petit rappel, de créer un contraste ensuite avec le S30. Essaie mentalement d'utiliser ce contraste à ton avantage pour trouver le S30 \"facile\" et gagner en efficacité gestuelle, au lieu de trouver ça intense et désagréable.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":211,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"n